12d:T8e8,![](/images/cms/pq-mex-bild-3be787.webp)

## Key Features

- Automatic operation and easy handling: The PQMex software is user-friendly and enables quick set-up through recipe control for different materials.
- Control of bubble diameter, fill level control, hopper control, automatic feeding, and other requirements.
- Automatic pellet feeding: Automatic material transfer from the recycling extruder to the PQMex hopper.
- Online quality grading: Measures and classifies gels/defects in real time.
- Quality analytics and database: All data is stored in an internal SQL database, providing historical data and quality statistics.
- Online MFI measurement: Via general interfaces to the line equipment and all available sensors of the line.
- Easy mechanical integration: Perfect for recycling production. PQMex size (L=1850; W=700; H=2000). Parallel to the recycling line.
- Electronic odor system for detection of pellet odor.
- AI technology to optimize recycling through AIREC.
- Check how extrusion parameters can influence gel formation. Analyze surface impurities according to customer-specific areas (gels/1 m², gels/100 cm² and more).

![](/images/cms/pq-mex-screenshot-result-a04b1b.webp)

*PQMex Ergebnisanalyse*

## Analyzing and saving historical data

- Set up and use our system quickly with our recipe-based system that helps you quickly load settings for your production.
- With vSTAT's statistical reporting, you can easily customize reports so that you see the information that is most important to you.
- With the Smart Classifier function, the system can recognize and classify defects, system data by type, size, area and processability in film production.

## Fast return on investment

With R.A.M. you benefit from a state-of-the-art technology that improves your recycling quality and operational efficiency and ensures a fast ROI!\
For more information or to schedule a demonstration of PQMex, visit us online on our website or contact us at our office. We look forward to working with you and helping you achieve excellence in every product you manufacture.\
Trust R.A.M. to maintain your standards and keep your products at the highest level.\
